  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/XXIII/282-A/282-A-25.htm",
  "statuteText": "282-A:25 Weekly Benefit Amount for Total Unemployment and Maximum Total Amount of Benefits Payable During any Benefit Year. –\n\nI. The maximum weekly benefit amount and maximum benefits payable to an eligible individual, the first day of whose individual benefit year is on or after the effective date of this paragraph, shall be determined by the individual's annual earnings, of which in each of 2 calendar quarters the individual must have earned not less than $1,400, as follows:\nAnnual Earnings of Maximum Weekly Maximum\nNot Less Than Benefit Amount Benefits\n$ 2,800 $ 32 $ 832\n3,100 35 910\n3,400 39 1,014\n3,900 45 1,170\n4,200 48 1,248\n4,500 52 1,352\n4,800 55 1,430\n5,100 59 1,534\n5,600 64 1,664\n6,100 69 1,794\n6,600 75 1,950\n7,000 80 2,080\n7,400 83 2,158\n7,800 88 2,288\n8,200 92 2,392\n8,600 96 2,496\n9,000 101 2,626\n9,500 105 2,730\n10,000 110 2,860\n10,500 115 2,990\n11,000 120 3,120\n11,500 126 3,276\n12,500 137 3,562\n13,500 148 3,848\n14,500 159 4,134\n15,500 167 4,342\n16,500 178 4,628\n17,500 188 4,888\n18,500 199 5,174\n19,500 206 5,356\n20,500 217 5,642\n21,500 227 5,902\n22,500 238 6,188\n23,500 249 6,474\n24,500 254 6,604\n25,500 265 6,890\n26,500 275 7,150\n27,500 286 7,436\n28,500 290 7,540\n29,500 301 7,826\n30,500 311 8,086\n31,500 321 8,346\n32,500 331 8,606\n33,500 342 8,892\n34,500 352 9,152\n35,500 362 9,412\n36,500 372 9,672\n37,500 383 9,958\n38,500 394 10,244\n39,500 405 10,530\n40,500 416 10,816\n41,500 427 11,102\nII, III. [Repealed.]"
